import source_annotations.dl

to get {a pointer to UI source query:query} [is current for UI source document] {a pointer to UI source document:document}:
    return document's available and (((query's revision = document's revision) and (query's context = document's context)) and ((query's project = document's project) and (query's project revision = document's project's revision)))

to get [the next pending UI source query in] {a pointer to UI source document:document}:
    set query to document's queries
    loop while query != @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI source query):
        if (query is current for UI source document document) = false:
            cancel UI source query query
        if query's queued:
            return query
        set query to query's next
    return @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI source query)

to get {a pointer to UI source document:document} [has pending UI source queries]:
    return (the next pending UI source query in document) != @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI source query)

to get [request UI source feature] {string:method} [with parameters] {a pointer to JSON value:parameters} [in] {a pointer to UI source document:document}:
    require condition (document's available) reporting "A source feature was requested for an unavailable document"
    set query to document's queries
    set found to false
    loop while (query != @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI source query)) and (found = false):
        set found to query's method = method
        if found = false:
            set query to query's next
    if query = @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI source query):
        set query to storage for one slot initialized with (a new UI source query)
        set query's method to method
        set query's parameters to a new JSON-RPC null
        set query's result to a new JSON-RPC null
        set query's next to document's queries
        set document's queries to query
    set copied to a copy of JSON-RPC node parameters
    free query's parameters
    set query's parameters to copied
    free query's result
    set query's result to a new JSON-RPC null
    set query's context to document's context
    set query's project to document's project
    set query's project revision to document's project's revision
    set query's revision to document's revision
    increment query's generation
    set query's queued to true
    set query's ready to false
    set query's notification to false
    return query

to get [request UI source feature] {string:method} [at byte] {integer:offset} [in] {a pointer to UI source document:document}:
    set parameters to a JSON object containing [
        JSON child "textDocument" is (an LSP text document identifier for (document's uri)),
        JSON child "position" is (the UI analysis position for source byte offset in document)
    ]
    set query to request UI source feature method with parameters parameters in document
    free parameters
    return query

to get [request UI source feature] {string:method} [in] {a pointer to UI source document:document}:
    set parameters to a JSON object containing [JSON child "textDocument" is (an LSP text document identifier for (document's uri))]
    set query to request UI source feature method with parameters parameters in document
    free parameters
    return query

to get [notify UI source feature] {string:method} [with parameters] {a pointer to JSON value:parameters} [in] {a pointer to UI source document:document}:
    set query to request UI source feature method with parameters parameters in document
    set query's notification to true
    return query
